note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Frozen DRA-420/DRA-387 evaluation plan (docs/abft/CONTRACT.md section 6). Its SHA256 is
note committed in tests/abft/FROZEN.sha256 in the same commit, before any checker or tolerance
note tuning. The candidate never reads this file; the evaluator owns rows, seeds, S and deadline.
note Row: 0 id 1 dt 2 m 3 n 4 k 5 w 6 pol 7 tgt 8 site 9 fault 10 sub 11 p1 12 p2 13 seed 14 reps 15 flags
note dt 0 exact u32 (mod 2^32), 1 bf16 x bf16 -> f32. pol 0 round robin, 1 seeded random, 2 run
note ahead of tgt, 3 delay tgt at site. site 0 none, 1 load, 2 compute, 3 barrier arrival,
note 4 intra-unit atomic (unsupported), 5 device instruction stream (unsupported).
note fault 0 none, 1 single bit p2, 2 multi count p1 class p2 (0 any, 1 bits 23..31, 2 bits 0..7),
note 3 stale (sub 1 skip init, 2 skip write, 3 identical stale), rows p1..p1+p2-1,
note 4 index (sub 1 drop K tail, 2 transposed B, 3 row offset, 4 out-of-bounds write),
note 5 sync (sub 1 no load barrier, 2 no compute barrier, 3 barrier counts workers 0..1 only,
note 4 worker 0 skips a barrier: hang), 6 known undetected (sub 1 exact 2x2 rectangle of 2^31,
note sub 3 bf16 2x2 rectangle +e -e -e +e with e = 2^p1), 7 common-mode A corruption at p1 bf16 bit p2.
note flags bit0 transient fault, bit1 known-bad control (may remove a wait), bit2 timing row,
note bit3 reduced-concurrency partner of the previous row.
global pl ulong 1024
global pn ulong 1
global pcur ulong 1
global pcfg ulong 4
fn prow id ulong dt ulong m ulong n ulong k ulong w ulong to void
b = mul sub id 1 16
put pcur 0 b
put pl b id
put pl add b 1 dt
put pl add b 2 m
put pl add b 3 n
put pl add b 4 k
put pl add b 5 w
put pn 0 id
end
fn prpol pol ulong tgt ulong site ulong to void
b = get pcur 0
put pl add b 6 pol
put pl add b 7 tgt
put pl add b 8 site
end
fn prf flt ulong sb ulong p1 ulong p2 ulong to void
b = get pcur 0
put pl add b 9 flt
put pl add b 10 sb
put pl add b 11 p1
put pl add b 12 p2
end
fn prs seed ulong reps ulong flags ulong to void
b = get pcur 0
put pl add b 13 seed
put pl add b 14 reps
put pl add b 15 flags
end
fn pfill to void
note config: 0 sampled elements S, 1 child deadline ns, 2 retries after detection, 3 plan version
put pcfg 0 64
put pcfg 1 20000000000
put pcfg 2 1
put pcfg 3 1
